Package: cigamingos-branding
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CiGaming <admin@snugglesmp.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: base-files, desktop-base
Recommends: plymouth, plymouth-themes
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: CiGaming OS identity and artwork
 Makes a Debian system identify as @OS_NAME@: os-release, login banner,
 GRUB menu and background, Plymouth boot splash, wallpaper, SDDM login
 background, icons and the KDE Plasma color scheme.
 .
 Debian's own files are diverted, not overwritten, so removing this
 package restores stock Debian branding.
